   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **I Can't Put My Finger On It** (1 review): Rain began as this song started; its long intro felt like summoning the rain, after the crowd was mostly spared until then [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Track18**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Track19**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **09-track-09_20200827** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 112 min [1]\n- **ween2001-08-24.flac16**: source not stated; 23 songs; 120 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Tenacious D and Galactic opened; the reviewer's group drove 16 hours to attend [3]\n- A storm moved over downtown Denver behind the stage, with bright lightning bolts striking around the sky and city [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2001-08-24.flac16**: source: FOB km140's>mp-2>adc-20>p1 [2]",
